    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="SQLmap介绍"><a href="#SQLmap介绍" class="headerlink" title="SQLmap介绍"></a>SQLmap介绍</h2><p><a href="https://so.csdn.net/so/search?q=SQLMap&spm=1001.2101.3001.7020">SQLMap</a>是一款开源的渗透测试工具，它可以自动检测和利用SQL注入漏洞，并对数据库执行相应的攻击。常用的方法主要有两种，一种针对get传参扫描，一种针对post传参扫描，<br>不同的请求扫描方式如下：</p><ol><li>get 请求: python sqlmap.py -u <a href="http://127.0.0.1/DVWA-master/vulnerabilities/sqli/?id=1">http://127.0.0.1/DVWA-master/vulnerabilities/sqli/?id=1</a></li><li>post 请求：首先通过burpsuite抓包，把请求包的信息保存到文件中，通用sqlmap -r 读去&#96;&#96;&#96;</li></ol><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs nginx"><span class="hljs-comment"># 判断是否存在注入点</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">sqlmap</span> -r “请求包路径” <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130323.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130311.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130426.png"></p><p><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130552.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130650.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130748.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130810.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130848.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130907.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027130950.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027131041.png"><br><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020241027131050.png"></p>]]></content>
    
    
    
